{"seq":12,"slug":"recommender-systems","title":"推荐系统","stage":"DONE","category":"data-science","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommender-systems","rating":{"composite":3.58,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 推荐系统\n\n打开任何一个内容或电商 App，你看到的首屏几乎都不是人工编排的，而是一套推荐系统在毫秒级里从上亿候选中替你挑出的几十个条目。这门技术的核心矛盾很朴素：候选规模巨大、用户耐心有限、反馈信号嘈杂又带偏，而你必须在严苛的延迟预算内给出既准又不无聊的结果。本 hub 沿着一条工程师真正会走的路径，把推荐系统从问题定义讲到线上系统的全貌。\n\n第一章「基础」先把地基打牢。我们不急着上模型，而是先问清楚三件事：推荐到底要预测什么（评分、点击、还是下一个交互）；数据从哪来、显式评分与隐式行为有何本质差异以及隐式信号「只有正例没有负例」的陷阱；以及怎样判断一个推荐器是好是坏——离线指标、在线 A/B、以及二者经常打架的原因。没有这一章，后面所有模型都是在沙上盖楼。\n\n第二章「经典方法」回到推荐系统的源头。协同过滤用「人以群分、物以类聚」的朴素直觉就能跑出可观效果；矩阵分解把用户和物品压进同一个隐空间，奠定了此后十余年的隐向量范式；基于内容与混合推荐则补上了纯协同过滤搞不定的冷启动与可解释性。这些方法至今仍是大量中小系统的主力，也是理解深度模型的必要前置。\n\n第三章「深度学习推荐」是当下工业界的主战场。Embedding 与双塔结构让召回得以在亿级候选上做近似最近邻检索；CTR 排序模型从 Wide&Deep、DeepFM 一路演进到各种特征交叉与注意力结构；序列与图建模则进一步刻画用户兴趣的演化与物品间的高阶关系，2024 年以来以 HSTU 为代表的生成式推荐更把 NLP 的 scaling law 第一次搬进了推荐场景。\n\n第四章「系统与实践」回到落地。召回-排序-重排的多级漏斗是几乎所有大型系统的骨架；冷启动与多样性决定了系统能否长期健康而非越推越窄；偏差、反馈回路与伦理则提醒我们：推荐系统不只是在预测世界，它也在塑造世界。四章层层递进——基础给语言，经典给直觉，深度给火力，系统给全局——读完你会拥有一张能把任何推荐问题拆解清楚的地图。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommender-systems/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"problem-formulation","title":"推荐问题建模与范式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommender-systems/foundations/problem-formulation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-feedback","title":"数据与显隐式反馈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommender-systems/foundations/data-feedback"},{"seq":3,"slug":"evaluation-metrics","title":"评估指标与离线在线评测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommender-systems/foundations/evaluation-metrics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"classic-methods","title":"经典方法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommender-systems/classic-methods","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"collaborative-filtering","title":"协同过滤","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommender-systems/classic-methods/collaborative-filtering"},{"seq":2,"slug":"matrix-factorization","title":"矩阵分解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommender-systems/classic-methods/matrix-factorization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"content-based","title":"基于内容与混合推荐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommender-systems/classic-methods/content-based"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"deep-learning","title":"深度学习推荐","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommender-systems/deep-learning","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"embedding-recall","title":"Embedding 与双塔召回","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommender-systems/deep-learning/embedding-recall"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ranking-models","title":"排序模型与 CTR 预估","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommender-systems/deep-learning/ranking-models"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sequence-graph","title":"序列与图推荐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommender-systems/deep-learning/sequence-graph"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"systems-practice","title":"系统与实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommender-systems/systems-practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"recall-rank-architecture","title":"召回-排序-重排架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommender-systems/systems-practice/recall-rank-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cold-start-diversity","title":"冷启动与多样性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommender-systems/systems-practice/cold-start-diversity"},{"seq":3,"slug":"bias-feedback-loops","title":"偏差、反馈回路与伦理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommender-systems/systems-practice/bias-feedback-loops"}]}]}